From 1afc9d9712415bd9273f756817a8e29a512d0105 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Canoziia <canoziia@projectk.org>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:04:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(deepseek-v4.1): topology-aware SM80 collectives, native
 fusions, and tep4_fused profile

Add automatic NVLink vs PCIe P2P topology detection (ampere_peer_topology), CuTe Lamport AllReduce & Markov symmetric exchange, fused gate/top-k/align, w2_splitk_ep with fused shared add, C++ woa_mxfp8_splitk, TP-local greedy verify, dequant_marlin_mxfp8 cuBLAS prefill, in-graph text embed, and tep4_fused profile.
